      "note": [
        "Refers to employees aged 18–68 for whom we can report salaries. Until 2013, the upper age limit was 64 years. From 2023, the upper age limit has been increased from 66 years to 68 years.",
        "Variable supplements are partly or entirely missing for a few municipalities and Local federation.",
        "All numbers are rounded to the nearest hundred unless the number is under 1000 and then the numbers are rounded to the nearest ten. The salary information are rounded to the nearest hundred. Totals are calculated before rounding.",
        "From 2022 about 30,000 positions have been moved from Community care services and social employments to Education."
